"post-graduate college" means a University college or an affiliated college situate within the University area and
providing post-graduate courses of study leading upto the post-graduate degrees of the University;
(i)
"prescribed" means prescribed by this Act or the statutes, ordinances or regulations;
(j)
"Principal" means the head of a college;
(k)
